>than 8-10 seconds in duration then the audioserver gets out of sync
>with itself and you get a broken playback.

The longest Sun .au file I have handy is Roxanne.au - the Police song,
in full. It is 182.5 seconds and plays all through without any
problems.

This is a bit different from your findings - perhaps your hardware is
set up differently / incorrectly?

