Just a guess...

You didn't mention what transport you are trying to use.
The default transport for the VMS  SET DISPLAY command is
usually DECNET, and unless your Iris is running Decnet
the connection will be refused.  [To see the transport
method, type SHOW DISPLAY].

If you have Multinet or UCX or some other TCPIP running on
your VAX, you can try:
  SET DISPLAY/CREATE/NODE=.../TRANSPORT=TCPIP
Your DECWindows installation may also have to be configured to
support this transport method.

